  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.6.7.410",
  "reference": "Lotka AJ. Elements of Physical Biology. Williams & Wilkins, 1925; Volterra V. Variations and fluctuations of the number of individuals in animal species living together. ICES J Mar Sci. 1928."
